                    hint_trust:             `Trust is close to the 55 floor where the promise breaks. Stop pushing and start disclosing — own the hard truth, fund the human side, and re-engage the anchor before adoption can recover.`,
                    hint_ei:                `Your EI alignment is low — you're leading from instinct, not consciously. Dial up empathy and self-regulation; in this culture, push-facts-pace is the trap you were warned about.`,
                    hint_resistance:        `Resistance is still high — the anchor hasn't moved. Diagnose her loss, coach rather than command, and bring her into the design; she carries ~60% of the division.`,
